Hmph.

I had a pretty good bit to post on LFS'ing an alpha (most of this=20
stuff I just discovered myself), but I'll have to do it piece by=20
piece, it seems.  None of it's in the LFS book (not even CVS).

First, the glibc patch to fix your original issue (see below).

Second, findutils needs to be compiled with=20
CPPFLAGS=3D-D_GNU_SOURCE, else the "find" utility doesn't end up=20
64-bit clean.

--=20
Kelledin
"If a server crashes in a server farm and no one pings it, does=20
it still cost four figures to fix?"

--------------Boundary-00=_5NMHWFQR7FJK61F0XVAD
