http://www.linuxfromscratch.org/

Once you get an LFS system built, you could compile rpm, then 
start building your SRPMs.  You'll have to build some of them 
with --nodeps, at least until you get a working set of baseline 
RPMs.  I can't really help you much beyond that, since I don't 
actually use redhat myself.

