deleted. I have seen nothing on-list about it since.  

a little late, as my manual had gone missing.

To clear the password on the PWS ("Miata") series machines, simply press
the reset button on the motherboard. It is located at the top of the
board, right of thememory slots, and a bit above and left of the COM 2
port.

